        "answer": {
          "short": "$10.6$ units",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{rise} &= -5-2=-7\\\\\\text{run} &= 2-(-6)=8\\\\d &= \\sqrt{(-7)^2+8^2}\\\\d &= \\sqrt{113}\\\\d &\\approx 10.6\\text{ units}\\end{align*}$$",
